y conversation - establishes how to find and use skills, requiring skill invocation before ANY response including clarifying questions"},{"name":"superpowers:verification-before-completion","description":"(plugin: superpowers - Skill) Use when about to claim work is complete, fixed, or passing, before committing or creating PRs - requires running verification commands and confirming output before making any success claims; evidence before assertions always"},{"name":"superpowers:writing-plans","description":"(plugin: superpowers - Skill) Use when you have a spec or requirements for a multi-step task, before touching code"},{"name":"superpowers:writing-skills","description":"(plugin: superpowers - Skill) Use when creating new skills, editing existing skills, or verifying skills work before deployment"},{"name":"test-driven-development","description":"(user - Skill) Drives development with tests. Use when implementing any logic, fixing any bug, or changing any behavior. Use when you need to prove that code works, when a bug report arrives, or when you're about to modify existing functionality."},{"name":"tool-design","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to \"design agent tools\", \"create tool descriptions\", \"reduce tool complexity\", \"implement MCP tools\", or mentions tool consolidation, architectural reduction, tool naming conventions, or agent-tool interfaces."},{"name":"turnstile-spin","description":"(user - Skill) Set up Cloudflare Turnstile end-to-end in a project. Scan the codebase, create the widget via the Cloudflare API, embed it on the right forms, wire canonical server-side siteverify in the customer's existing backend, validate, and persist the skill. Load this when a user asks to add Turnstile, set up CAPTCHA, protect a form from bots, or fix a Turnstile integration. Mirrors developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/spin."},{"name":"ulw-loop","description":"(builtin) Start ultrawork loop - continues until completion with ultrawork mode"},{"name":"usage","description":"Show subscription usage as formatted table"},{"name":"usage-toast","description":"Show subscription usage as toast notification"},{"name":"using-agent-skills","description":"(user - Skill) Discovers and invokes agent skills. Use when starting a session or when you need to discover which skill applies to the current task. This is the meta-skill that governs how all other skills are discovered and invoked."},{"name":"visual-qa","description":"MUST USE after building/changing any UI or when asked whether a page, component, or TUI looks right. Rigorous visual QA across web/page and terminal UIs. Prefer browser:control-in-app-browser for unauthenticated browser/page QA in Codex, then Playwright/agent-browser/dev-browser. Captures screenshot/TUI evidence with bundled diff scripts, runs design-system/functional and visual-fidelity/CJK reviewer passes, then synthesizes a good/bad verdict. Triggers: visual QA, screenshot/pixel diff, UI looks wrong, reference fidelity, design system check, responsive check, CJK text clipping, TUI alignment, box-drawing drift."},{"name":"web-perf","description":"(user - Skill) Analyzes web performance using Chrome DevTools MCP. Measures Core Web Vitals (LCP, INP, CLS) and supplementary metrics (FCP, TBT, Speed Index), identifies render-blocking resources, network dependency chains, layout shifts, caching issues, and accessibility gaps. Use when asked to audit, profile, debug, or optimize page load performance, Lighthouse scores, or site speed. Biases towards retrieval from current documentation over pre-trained knowledge."},{"name":"websearch:web_search_help","description":"Get help with web search using Exa"},{"name":"weekly-review","description":"(user - Skill) 每週回顧。觸發詞：「週回顧」、「本週總結」、「週檢視」、「weekly review」、「這週回顧一下」。用於整理本週 daily notes、清理 Clippings/、更新 memory.md、識別重複問題。每週結束時使用。"},{"name":"workers-best-practices","description":"(user - Skill) Reviews and authors Cloudflare Workers code against production best practices. Load when writing new Workers, reviewing Worker code, configuring wrangler.jsonc, or checking for common Workers anti-patterns (streaming, floating promises, global state, secrets, bindings, observability). Biases towards retrieval from Cloudflare docs over pre-trained knowledge."},{"name":"working-directory-router","description":"(user - Skill) 派 worker (start_task) 時自動填寫 directory 參數、依任務性質路由到 vault / 本機開發專案 / 群兆 SharePoint sync / OneDrive 等本機常用路徑。**通用、非限定 MSP**。設計理由 / 規則 / 邊界詳見 vault `00.System/Skills/working-directory-router/working-directory-router.md`。"},{"name":"wrangler","description":"(user - Skill) Cloudflare Workers CLI for deploying, developing, and managing Workers, KV, R2, D1, Vectorize, Hyperdrive, Workers AI, Containers, Queues, Workflows, Pipelines, and Secrets Store. Load before running wrangler commands to ensure correct syntax and best practices. Biases towards retrieval from Cloudflare docs over pre-trained knowledge."},{"name":"zhijian-review","description":"(user - Skill) Review Chinese markdown before saving it into the Obsidian vault. Use this for vault-bound external copy, rewritten PDF notes, translated drafts, client communication, marketing content, and long-form Chinese writing that must be checked against the vault-based 支檢長 SOT and converted from PRC wording to Taiwan-local usage. Not a translator and not a rewrite-from-scratch skill — runs after drafting, before commit. 設計理由 / 雙層架構 / 變更紀錄詳見 vault `00.System/Skills/zhijian-review/zhijian-review.md`。"},{"name":"群兆教育訓練","description":"(user - Skill) 使用群兆資訊既有素材、共同語言與風格標準,產出 50-60 分鐘座談會式內部訓練課程(含大綱、內容、逐字稿),最終以 Gamma 輸出簡報。當使用者要求製作群兆內訓、員工訓練、教育訓練課程、訓練模組、訓練系列時套用。"},{"name":"群兆文案大師","description":"(user - Skill) 群兆資訊對外文案／行銷／客戶溝通 SKILL；v2.6 全網對齊 [[規範-群兆 Brand Voice 鐵則_2026-05-14]] 21 條商業層級鐵則"}]}}}
